{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command Earth, Water, Air and Fire to create the landscapes of your imagination, from tiny single islands to networks of variable landmasses, to large continents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/extras/ffd350882720203455e4d388c1011fff.poster.avif?t=1770741054\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/extras/ffd350882720203455e4d388c1011fff.webm?t=1770741054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/extras/ffd350882720203455e4d388c1011fff.mp4?t=1770741054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/extras/0cca7b700a381baf47fec8aff7a4a3ff.poster.avif?t=1770741054\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/extras/0cca7b700a381baf47fec8aff7a4a3ff.webm?t=1770741054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/extras/0cca7b700a381baf47fec8aff7a4a3ff.mp4?t=1770741054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control dynamic localized weather to allow a variety of vegetation and herds of animals to survive, and even flourish. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/extras/2594b4062a191588cfe0b9b0a804eb51.poster.avif?t=1770741054\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/extras/2594b4062a191588cfe0b9b0a804eb51.webm?t=1770741054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/extras/2594b4062a191588cfe0b9b0a804eb51.mp4?t=1770741054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lay out towns to house growing populations, establish outposts to gather resources, and encourage trade via road, river and sea routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/extras/bef8a5acc415963d32932f1bb01cdf67.poster.avif?t=1770741054\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/extras/bef8a5acc415963d32932f1bb01cdf67.webm?t=1770741054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/extras/bef8a5acc415963d32932f1bb01cdf67.mp4?t=1770741054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the freedom of a gridless interactive sandbox and cement your reputation in the Halls Of The Minor Deities.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876240?t=1770741054","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/26a095396069a99335d4583f4cd3bfcd118cbbaa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770741054","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/62e807c7f26d672e7ef33eb367b00598a978764b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770741054","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/62e807c7f26d672e7ef33eb367b00598a978764b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770741054","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Siz