l dynamic localized weather to allow a variety of vegetation and herds of animals to survive, and even flourish. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/extras/2594b4062a191588cfe0b9b0a804eb51.poster.avif?t=1770741054\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/extras/2594b4062a191588cfe0b9b0a804eb51.webm?t=1770741054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/extras/2594b4062a191588cfe0b9b0a804eb51.mp4?t=1770741054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lay out towns to house growing populations, establish outposts to gather resources, and encourage trade via road, river and sea routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/extras/bef8a5acc415963d32932f1bb01cdf67.poster.avif?t=1770741054\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/extras/bef8a5acc415963d32932f1bb01cdf67.webm?t=1770741054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/extras/bef8a5acc415963d32932f1bb01cdf67.mp4?t=1770741054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the freedom of a gridless interactive sandbox and cement your reputation in the Halls Of The Minor Deities.</p>","developers":["Re: cOg Mission"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876240/79ff6515ac268805fd5e26809fa8496697374ffb/header.jpg?t=1770741